  {# Ignition Radar strip + "Big Seven" leadership board REMOVED 2026-07-23 (operator ruling — forced Mag-7 call failed; see research/DO_NOT_REBUILD.md §2/§4 and research/POSTMORTEM_20260723_MAG7_FORCED_CALL_BY_FABLE.md). Engine lanes (mag7_regime, ignition_radar) keep accruing in the background. #}
