                 '仅取自今日周期引擎的读数，原样展示。最弱支撑：仍支撑当前判断的最弱分量 — 斜率 z ' ~ (_fc.get('z') | round(2) if _fc.get('z') is not none else '—') ~ '，阈值 ±' ~ (_fc.get('threshold') | round(2) if _fc.get('threshold') is not none else '—') ~ '（边际 ' ~ (_fc.get('margin') | round(2) if _fc.get('margin') is not none else '—') ~ '）。漂移方向：模型周期概率近 ' ~ (_tm.get('window_sessions') or '—') ~ ' 个交易日的变化。把握程度：0–1 = 标签背后的概率 × 输入一致度。仅为条件性参考 — 并非预测翻转。') }}
        <span class="mxfs-badge">{{ t('Context — not a forecast','情景参考 — 非预测') }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mxfs-subtitle">{{ t('About the regime label — not the 0-100 risk score.','指上方周期标签——并非 0-100 风险评分。') }}</div>
      {# When the label's own axes no longer support it there IS no supporting component
         to name, and naming one presents anti-evidence as support (the defect the engine
         fixed in flip_condition — it now returns component=None + label_unsupported).
