          <span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ t('Strongest runners by edge — no fresh entry signal; watch, don’t chase.', '按优势排名的最强领跑股 — 暂无新入场信号；观察，勿追高。') }}
            {{ help("Coverage of the market's strongest runners — the piece the entry-gated board above structurally cannot show. The board admits a name only on a fresh momentum cross; a leader that has been running for months rarely prints one (of the top-100 three-month runners on 2026-07-28, only 2 passed the gate). These names rank by edge (α — sector-neutral residual momentum, the one leg our measurements ranked positively) and must be in an intact uptrend (above the 200-day line, weekly structure bullish). The entry column is honest: none of these has a fresh trigger, so the stance is watch — buy pullbacks toward the zone, never chase. Forward results for this strip are graded nightly from its ship date; it is a research shortlist, not a buy list.", "覆盖市场上最强的领跑股 — 上方入场门控榜单在结构上无法展示的部分。榜单只在动量新交叉时收录个股；已连涨数月的领跑股很少出现新交叉（2026-07-28 实测：三个月涨幅前100名中仅2只通过门控）。此处按优势排名（α — 行业中性残差动量，我们测量中唯一正向排序的指标），并要求趋势完好（站上200日线、周线结构看多）。入场列如实标注：这些标的均无新触发，立场是观察 — 回调至买区分批买入，绝不追高。本栏前瞻成绩自上线之日起每晚评分；这是研究清单，而非买入清单。") }}</span>
