  {% if mode != 'macro' %}
  <!-- ===================== US EQUITY SCOREBOARD (size + breadth + internals) ===================== -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="equity-scoreboard">
    <span id="size-style"></span><span id="breadth"></span><span id="advanced-breadth"></span>
    <h2>{{ t('Market breadth — S&P 1500', '市场广度 — 标普1500') }}
      {{ help("How broad is the tape. Advancers vs decliners, % of the S&P 1500 above their 50- and 200-day lines, and net new 52-week highs — refreshed intraday from a ~15-min-delayed feed when US markets are open, falling back to the last close otherwise (the stamp always says which you are seeing). The % above the 50-day also feeds the regime model's growth axis. The Momentum tile and the Full board (per-tier tables, McClellan internals, history) update nightly. Internals are display-only, second-derivative reads: they explain the tape, they do not forecast it.", "盘面广度一览：上涨/下跌家数、标普1500中高于50日与200日均线的占比、净新高 — 美股开盘时按约15分钟延迟数据刷新，否则回退至上一收盘（时间戳始终注明当前口径）。高于50日线的占比同时输入周期模型的增长轴。动量与完整看板（分层级表格、麦克莱伦内部结构、历史）每夜更新。内部结构仅作展示：解释盘面，不预测盘面。") }}
    </h2>
    {# ⚡ SBX compact glance layer (Phase 2, research/LIVE_TAPE_SCOREBOARD_MASTERPLAN.md §4;
       operator 2026-07-24, 同花顺 reference). Size & Style table REMOVED by ruling (D5) —
       anchors above stay for alert deep-links. Deep tables + internals DEMOTED into the
       #sbx-dlg dialog below. live.js patches ids sbx-* from live/breadth.json when fresh;
       baked numbers + "last close" stamp otherwise. Stance words mirror _breadth_read
       bands (scripts/build_site.py) — keep the two in lockstep. #}
    <style>
    .sbx-hd{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}
